,750, omen (Lurker) $3,650.\nFull buy now costs your team about $6,200 (affordable).\nLoss bonus: if you lose this round each player gets $1,400 (level 0/4; each loss raises it one level, each win lowers it one level).\nKept from last round: nexa: AK-47, kevlar+helmet; tecno: AK-47, kevlar+helmet; juno: AK-47, kevlar+helmet; bolt: AK-47, kevlar+helmet.\nEnemy (CT) estimated money: $17,000-$21,500 (probably cannot full buy); they kept 0 rifle(s)/AWP; their next loss pays $2,900 each (level 3/4).\nAWP: you have no AWP kept (a full buy with \"awp\":true buys one if the AWPer can afford it); the enemy kept no AWP.\nOpponent's last rounds as CT (oldest first):\n- R1 [they CT] pistol buy: standard_2_1_2 (2 A, 1 mid, 2 B), threw 0 utility; we hit A -> we won (bomb exploded)\n- R2 [they CT] eco buy: standard_2_1_2 (2 A, 1 mid, 2 B), threw 4 utility; we hit B -> we won (elimination)\nTheir CT-side tendencies this match (2 rounds): standard_2_1_2 x2.\nYour last rounds as T (oldest first):\n- R1 [we T] pistol buy: default_mid, utility flash_heavy, pace default vs their standard_2_1_2 (pistol buy) -> we WON (bomb exploded)\n- R2 [we T] full buy: split_b, utility full, pace default vs their standard_2_1_2 (eco buy) -> we WON (elimination)\n","schema":"{\"buy\":\"eco|half|force|full\",\"strategy\":\"rush_a|rush_b|execute_a|execute_b|split_a|split_b|default_mid|fake_a_go_b|fake_b_go_a\",\"utility\":\"none|smokes|flash_heavy|full\",\"pace\":\"fast|default|slow\",\"awp\":true|false}\nbuy: eco = buy nothing and save; half = each player spends at most 45% of his money (max $2,100) on an SMG or P250, kevlar and a flash/smoke; force = spend everything on the best you can (AK/M4 if you can pay it plus kevlar, else Galil/FAMAS, else SMG, else Deagle/P250), then helmet, then your utility; full = rifles (the AWPer buys an AWP if \"awp\":true and he can pay it plus kevlar), helmets, kits (CT) and your utility; on a full buy rich players drop rifles to teammates who cannot afford one. In pist