d A, pace default, threw 3 smokes 7 flashes 3 molotovs; planted -> they won (bomb exploded)\n- R4 [they T] full buy: execute_a, hit A, pace default, threw 4 smokes 8 flashes 4 molotovs, AWP; planted -> they won (elimination)\n- R5 [they T] full buy: split_b, hit B, pace default, threw 5 smokes 10 flashes 4 molotovs, AWP; planted -> they won (bomb exploded)\n- R6 [they T] full buy: fake_a_go_b, hit B, faked A, pace default, threw 3 smokes 8 flashes 3 molotovs, AWP; no plant -> we won (time ran out)\nTheir T-side tendencies this match (6 rounds): default_mid x1, execute_a x1, fake_a_go_b x2, split_b x2; hit A x2, hit B x4.\nYour last rounds as CT (oldest first):\n- R2 [we CT] eco buy: standard_2_1_2, utility normal vs their split_b (full buy, hit B) -> we LOST (elimination)\n- R3 [we CT] eco buy: standard_2_1_2, utility save vs their fake_a_go_b (full buy, hit B) -> we LOST (bomb exploded)\n- R4 [we CT] full buy: standard_2_1_2, utility heavy vs their execute_a (full buy, hit A) -> we LOST (elimination)\n- R5 [we CT] eco buy: standard_2_1_2, utility save vs their split_b (full buy, hit B) -> we LOST (bomb exploded)\n- R6 [we CT] full buy: stack_b, utility heavy vs their fake_a_go_b (full buy, hit B) -> we WON (time ran out)\n","schema":"{\"buy\":\"eco|half|force|full\",\"setup\":\"standard_2_1_2|stack_a|stack_b|aggressive_mid|retake_b|retake_a\",\"utility\":\"save|normal|heavy\",\"awp\":true|false}\nbuy: eco = buy nothing and save; half = each player spends at most 45% of his money (max $2,100) on an SMG or P250, kevlar and a flash/smoke; force = spend everything on the best you can (AK/M4 if you can pay it plus kevlar, else Galil/FAMAS, else SMG, else Deagle/P250), then helmet, then your utility; full = rifles (the AWPer buys an AWP if \"awp\":true and he can pay it plus kevlar), helmets, kits (CT) and your utility; on a full buy rich players drop rifles to teammates who cannot afford one. In pistol rounds ($800) full and force both mean kevlar + pistol.\nsetup (see the round-win table in the rules): standard_2_1_2 = 2 A, 1 window, 2 B, rotate on contact (safest: beats rushes, loses to fakes and splits); stack_a / stack_b = 4 on that site, 1 on the other (crushes any hit on the stacked site, loses to hits on the other site, fakes of the stacked site and default_mid); aggressive_mid = 3 push mid for early picks, 1 per site (beats default_mid, splits and executes; rushes walk into its empty sites); retake_a / retake_b = give that site up (1 hidden player), 3 hold the other site, then retake together after the plant (beats rushes and executes into the held site, and rushes into the given site; loses to executes and default_mid into the given site).\nutility: save (none, $0) | normal (flash + smoke each, ~$500) | heavy (molotov, smoke, flash, HE each, ~$1,300: takes 1-13 points from the T, most vs rushes and hits into a defended site).\nawp: true = on a full buy your AWPer buys an AWP if he can afford it (+3-7 points: best in long, unsmoked holds)."},{"n":7,"side":1,"situation":"Map: Mirage. Round 7 (first half, round 7 of 12 of this half; first to 13 wins). You are T (attack: plant the bomb at A or B). Score: you 5 - 1 them.\nYour money: $40,950 total — nexa (IGL) $11,800, tecno (AWPer) $7,250, juno (Entry) $3,900, bolt (Support) $8,500, omen (Lurker) $9,500.\nFull buy now costs your team about $17,300 (affordable).\nLoss bonus: if you lose this round each player gets $1,900 (level 1/4; each loss raises it one level, each win lowers it one level).\nKept from last round: omen: AK-47, kevlar+helmet.\nEnemy (CT) estimated money: $23,000-$29,000 (can probably full buy); they kept 3 rifle(s)/AWP; their next loss pays $2,900 each (level 3/4).\nAWP: you have no AWP kept (a full buy with \"awp\":true buys one if the AWPer can afford it); the enemy kept an AWP.\nOpponent's last rounds as CT (oldest first):\n- R1 [they CT] pistol buy: standard_2_1_2 (2 A, 1 mid, 2 B), threw 0 utility; we hit A -> we won (bomb exploded)\n- R2 [they CT] eco b