 $28,950 total — drift (IGL) $5,800, ruin (AWPer) $2,550, oxide (Entry) $7,750, dazed (Support) $6,550, taz (Lurker) $6,300.\nFull buy now costs your team about $18,900 (affordable).\nLoss bonus: if you lose this round each player gets $2,900 (level 3/4; each loss raises it one level, each win lowers it one level).\nKept from last round: drift: M4A1-S, kevlar+helmet, kit.\nEnemy (T) estimated money: $24,500-$30,500 (can probably full buy); they kept 4 rifle(s)/AWP; their next loss pays $1,900 each (level 1/4).\nAWP: you have no AWP kept (a full buy with \"awp\":true buys one if the AWPer can afford it); the enemy kept an AWP.\nOpponent's last rounds as T (oldest first):\n- R3 [they T] full buy: fake_a_go_b, hit B, faked A, pace default, threw 3 smokes 7 flashes 3 molotovs; planted -> they won (bomb exploded)\n- R4 [they T] full buy: execute_a, hit A, pace default, threw 4 smokes 8 flashes 4 molotovs, AWP; planted -> they won (elimination)\n- R5 [they T] full buy: split_b, hit B, pace default, threw 5 smokes 10 flashes 4 molotovs, AWP; planted -> they won (bomb exploded)\n- R6 [they T] full buy: fake_a_go_b, hit B, faked A, pace default, threw 3 smokes 8 flashes 3 molotovs, AWP; no plant -> we won (time ran out)\n- R7 [they T] full buy: execute_a, hit A, pace default, threw 3 smokes 7 flashes 3 molotovs, AWP; planted -> we won (defused)\n- R8 [they T] full buy: execute_a, hit A, pace default, threw 3 smokes 6 flashes 3 molotovs, AWP; planted -> they won (bomb exploded)\nTheir T-side tendencies this match (8 rounds): default_mid x1, execute_a x3, fake_a_go_b x2, split_b x2; hit A x4, hit B x4.\nYour last rounds as CT (oldest first):\n- R4 [we CT] full buy: standard_2_1_2, utility heavy vs their execute_a (full buy, hit A) -> we LOST (elimination)\n- R5 [we CT] eco buy: standard_2_1_2, utility save vs their split_b (full buy, hit B) -> we LOST (bomb exploded)\n- R6 [we CT] full buy: stack_b, utility heavy vs their fake_a_go_b (full buy, hit B) -> we WON (time ran out)\n- R7 [we CT] full buy: stack_b, utility heavy vs their execute_a (full buy, hit A) -> we WON (defused)\n- R8 [we CT] full buy: standard_2_1_2, utility heavy vs their execute_a (full buy, hit A) -> we LOST (bomb exploded)\n","schema":"{\"buy\":\"eco|half|force|full\",\"setup\":\"standard_2_1_2|stack_a|stack_b|aggressive_mid|retake_b|retake_a\",\"utility\":\"save|normal|heavy\",\"awp\":true|false}\nbuy: eco = buy nothing and save; half = each player spends at most 45% of his money (max $2,100) on an SMG or P250, kevlar and a flash/smoke; force = spend everything on the best you can (AK/M4 if you can pay it plus kevlar, else Galil/FAMAS, else SMG, else Deagle/P250), then helmet, then your utility; full = rifles (the AWPer buys an AWP if \"awp\":true and he can pay it plus kevlar), helmets, kits (CT) and your utility; on a full buy rich players drop rifles to teammates who cannot afford one. In pistol rounds ($800) full and force both mean kevlar + pistol.\nsetup (see the round-win table in the rules): standard_2_1_2 = 2 A, 1 window, 2 B, rotate on contact (safest: beats rushes, loses to fakes and splits); stack_a / stack_b = 4 on that site, 1 on the other (crushes any hit on the stacked site, loses to hits on the other site, fakes of the stacked site and default_mid); aggressive_mid = 3 push mid for early picks, 1 per site (beats default_mid, splits and executes; rushes walk into its empty sites); retake_a / retake_b = give that site up (1 hidden player), 3 hold the other site, then retake together after the plant (beats rushes and executes into the held site, and rushes into the given site; loses to executes and default_mid into the given site).\nutility: save (none, $0) | normal (flash + smoke each, ~$500) | heavy (molotov, smoke, flash, HE each, ~$1,300: takes 1-13 points from the T, most vs rushes and hits into a defended site).\nawp: true = on a full buy your AWPer buys an AWP if he can afford it (+3-7 points: best in long, unsmoked holds)."},{"n":9,"side":1,"situation":"Map: Mirage. Round 9 (first half, round 9 of 12 of this half; first to 13 wins). You are T (attack: plant the bomb at A or B). Score: you 6 - 2 them.\nYour money: $27,650 total — nexa (IGL) $9,000, tecno (AWPer) $3,850, juno (Entry) $5,000, bolt (Support) $5,400, omen (Lurker) $4,400.\nFull buy now costs your team about $6,200 (affordable).\nLoss bonus: if you lose this round each player gets $1,900 (level 1/4; each loss raises it one level, each win lowers it one level).\nKept from last round: nexa: AK-47, kevlar+helmet; tecno: AWP, kevlar+helmet; bolt: AK-47, kevlar+helmet; omen: AK-47, kevlar+helmet.\nEnemy (CT) estimated money: $24,000-$29,500 (can probably full buy); they kept 1 rifle(s)/AWP; their next loss pays $2,900 each (level 3/4).\nAWP: you kept an AWP; the enemy kept no AWP.\nOpponent's last rounds as CT (oldest first):\n- R3 [they CT] eco buy: standard_2_1_2 (2 A, 1 mid, 2 B), threw 0 utility; we hit B -> we won (bomb exploded)\n- R4 [they CT] full buy: standard_2_1_2 (2 A, 1 mid, 2 B), threw 7 utility, AWP; we hit A -> we won (elimination)\n- R5 [they CT] eco buy: standard_2_1_2 (2 A, 1 mid, 2 B), threw 0 utility; we hit B -> we won (bomb exploded)\n- R6 [they CT] full buy: stack_b (1 A, 0 mid, 4 B), threw 12 utility, AWP; we hit B -> they won (time ran out)\n- R7 [they CT] full buy: stack_b (1 A, 0 mid, 4 B), threw 4 utility, AWP; we hit A -> they won (defused)\n- R8 [they CT] full buy: standard_2_1_2 (2 A, 1 mid, 2 B), threw 8 utility, AWP; we hit A -> we won (bomb exploded)\nTheir CT-side tendencies this match (8 rounds): stack_b x2, standard_2_1_2 x6.\nYour last rounds as T (oldest first):\n- R4 [we T] full buy: execute_a, utility full, pace default vs their standard_2_1_2 (full buy) -> we WON (elimination)\n- R5 [we T] full buy: split_b, utility full, pace default vs their standard_2_1_2 (eco buy) -> we WON (bomb exploded)\n- R6 [we T] full buy: fake_a_go_b, utility full, pace default vs their stack_b (full buy) -> we LOST (time ran out)\n- R7 [we T] full buy: execute_a, utility full, pace default vs their stack_b (full buy) -> we LOST (defused)\n- R8 [we T] full buy: execute_a, utility full, pace default vs their standard_2_1_2 (full buy) -> we WON (bomb exploded)\n","schema":"{\"buy\":\"eco|half|force|full\",\"strategy\":\"rush_a|rush_b|execute_a|execute_b|split_a|split_b|default_mid|fake_a_go_b|fake_b_go_a\",\"utility\":\"none|smokes|flash_heavy|full\",\"pace\":\"fast|default|slow\",\"awp\":true|false}\nbuy: eco = buy nothing and save; half = each player spends at most 45% of his money (max $2,100) on an SMG or P250, kevlar and a flash/smoke; force = spend everything on the best you can (AK/M4 if you can pay it plus kevlar, else Galil/FAMAS, else SMG, else Deagle/P250), then helmet, then your utility; full = rifles (the AWPer buys an AWP if \"awp\":true and he can pay it plus kevlar), helmets, kits (CT) and your utility; on a full buy rich players drop rifles to teammates who cannot afford one. In pistol rounds ($800) full and force both mean kevlar + pistol.\nstrategy (see the round-win table in the rules): rush_x = all 5 run into site x at once (beats aggressive_mid and a stack on the other site; loses to a stack on x, to standard and to retakes, especially vs heavy CT utility); execute_x = take control, then hit x together with utility (beats retake_x and standard a little; loses to a stack on x and to aggressive_mid); split_x = hit x from two sides (beats standard; loses to a stack on x and to aggressive_mid); default_mid = spread, fight for mid, hit late the site with fewer CTs (beats stacks and retakes; loses to aggressive_mid); fake_x_go_y = utility at x, then hit y (beats standard and a stack on x; loses to a stack on y).\nutility: none ($0) | smokes (smoke + flash each, ~$500) | flash_heavy (2 flashes + smoke, ~$700) | full (smoke, 2 flashes, molotov, ~$1,100). More utility wins more executes, splits, fakes and post-plants; rushes only use the flashes.\npace: fast (hit earlier: a little better vs aggressive_mid, a little worse vs the rest) | default (best in general) | slow (more mid duels: a little better for default_mid vs stacks, worse vs aggressive_mid). Rushes ignore pace.\nawp: true = on a full buy your AWPer buys an AWP if he can afford it (+3-7 points: best in long, unsmoked duels)."},{"n":10,"side":0,"situation":"Map: Mirage. Round 10 (first half, round 10 of 12 of this half; first to 13 wins). You are CT (defend A and B, defuse). Score: you 2 - 7 them.\nYour money: $22,750 total — drift (IGL) $8,700, ruin (AWPer) $3,050, oxide (Entry) $3,250, dazed (Support) $4,150, taz (Lurker) $3,600.\nFull buy now costs your team about $23,000 (affordable).\nLoss bonus: if you lose this round each player gets $3,400 (level 4/4; each loss raises it one level, each win lowers it one level).\nKept from last round: nothing.\nEnemy (T) estimated money: $35,500-$43,500 (can probably full buy); they kept 2 rifle(s)/AWP; their next loss pays $1,400 each (level 0/4).\nAWP: you have no AWP kept (a full buy with \"awp\":true buys one if the AWPer can afford it); the enemy kept an AWP.\nOpponent's last rounds as T (oldest first):\n- R4 [they T] full buy: execute_a, hit A, pace default, threw 4 smokes 8 flashes 4 molotovs, AWP; planted -> they won (elimination)\n- R5 [they T] full buy: split_b, hit B, pace default, threw 5 smokes 10 flashes 4 molotovs, AWP; planted -> they won (bomb exploded)\n- R6 [they T] full buy: fake_a_go_b, hit B, faked A, pace default, threw 3 smokes 8 flashes 3 molotovs, AWP; no plant -> we won (time ran out)\n- R7 [they T] full buy: execute_a, hit A, pace default, threw 3 smokes 7 flashes 3 molotovs, AWP; planted -> we won (defused)\n- R8 [they T] full buy: execute_a, hit A, pace default, threw 3 smokes 6 flashes 3 molotovs, AWP; planted -> they won (bomb exploded)\n- R9 [they T] full buy: fake_b_go_a, hit A, faked B, pace default, threw 4 smokes 7 flashes 3 molotovs, AWP; planted -> they won (elimination)\nTheir T-side tendencies this match (9 rounds): default_mid x1, execute_a x3, fake_a_go_b x2, fake_b_go_a x1, split_b x2; hit A x5, hit B x4.\nYour last rounds as CT (oldest first):\n- R5 [we CT] eco buy: standard_2_1_2, utility save vs their split_b (full buy, hit B) -> we LOST (bomb exploded)\n- R6 [we CT] full buy: stack_b, utility heavy vs their fake_a_go_b (full buy, hit B) -> we WON (time ran out)\n- R7 [we CT] full buy: stack_b, utility heavy vs their execute_a (full buy, hit A) -> we WON (defused)\n- R8 [we CT] full buy: standard_2_1_2, utility heavy vs their execute_a (full buy, hit A) -> we LOST (bomb exploded)\n- R9 [we CT] full buy: standard_2_1_2, utility heavy vs their fake_b_go_a (full buy, hit A) -> we LOST (elimination)\n","schema":"{\"buy\":\"eco|half|force|full\",\"setup\":\"standard_2_1_2|stack_a|stack_b|aggressive_mid|retake_b|retake_a\",\"utility\":\"save|normal|heavy\",\"awp\":true|false}\nbuy: eco = buy nothing and save; half = each player spends at most 45% of his money (max $2,100) on an SMG or P250, kevlar and a flash/smoke; force = spend everything on the best you can (AK/M4 if you can pay it plus kevlar, else Galil/FAMAS, else SMG, else Deagle/P250), then helmet, then your utility; full = rifles (the AWPer buys an AWP if \"awp\":true and he can pay it plus kevlar), helmets, kits (CT) and your utility; on a full buy rich players drop rifles to teammates who cannot afford one. In pistol rounds ($800) full and force both mean kevlar + pistol.\nsetup (see the round-win table in the rules): standard_2_1_2 = 2 A, 1 window, 2 B, rotate on contact (safest: beats rushes, loses to fakes and splits); stack_a / stack_b = 4 on that site, 1 on the other (crushes any hit on the stacked site, loses to hits on the other site, fakes of the stacked site and default_mid); aggressive_mid = 3 push mid for early picks, 1 per site (beats default_mid, splits and executes; rushes walk into its empty sites); retake_a / retake_b = give that site up (1 hidden player), 3 hold the other site, then r