 are T (attack: plant the bomb at A or B). Score: you 3 - 10 them.\nYour money: $8,350 total — drift (IGL) $2,050, ruin (AWPer) $2,050, oxide (Entry) $2,050, dazed (Support) $2,050, taz (Lurker) $150.\nFull buy now costs your team about $20,350 (NOT affordable).\nLoss bonus: if you lose this round each player gets $2,400 (level 2/4; each loss raises it one level, each win lowers it one level).\nIf you eco now and lose, you will have about $20,350 next round (still NOT enough for a full buy next round; a full buy from nothing costs about $21,000).\nKept from last round: taz: Glock-18, kevlar.\nEnemy (CT) estimated money: $16,000-$20,000 (probably cannot full buy); they kept 0 rifle(s)/AWP; their next loss pays $1,400 each (level 0/4).\nAWP: you have no AWP kept (a full buy with \"awp\":true buys one if the AWPer can afford it); the enemy kept no AWP.\nOpponent's last rounds as CT (oldest first):\n- R13 [they CT] pistol buy: standard_2_1_2 (2 A, 1 mid, 2 B), threw 0 utility; we hit B -> they won (time ran out)\nTheir CT-side tendencies this match (1 rounds): standard_2_1_2 x1.\nYour last rounds as T (oldest first):\n- R13 [we T] pistol buy: default_mid, utility flash_heavy, pace default vs their standard_2_1_2 (pistol buy) -> we LOST (time ran out)\n","schema":"{\"buy\":\"eco|half|force|full\",\"strategy\":\"rush_a|rush_b|execute_a|execute_b|split_a|split_b|default_mid|fake_a_go_b|fake_b_go_a\",\"utility\":\"none|smokes|flash_heavy|full\",\"pace\":\"fast|default|slow\",\"awp\":true|false}\nbuy: eco = buy nothing and save; half = each player spends at most 45% of his money (max $2,100) on an SMG or P250, kevlar and a flash/smoke; force = spend everything on the best you can (AK/M4 if you can pay it plus kevlar, else Galil/FAMAS, else SMG, else Deagle/P250), then helmet, then your utility; full = rifles (the AWPer buys an AWP if \"awp\":true and he can pay it plus kevlar), helmets, kits (CT) and your utility; on a full buy rich players drop rifles to teammates who cannot afford one. In pistol rounds ($800) full and force both mean kevlar + pistol.\nstrategy (see the round-win table in the rules): rush_x = all 5 run into site x at once (beats aggressive_mid and a stack on the other site; loses to a stack on x, to standard and to retakes, especially vs heavy CT utility); execute_x = take control, then hit x together with utility (beats retake_x and standard a little; loses to a stack on x and to aggressive_mid); split_x = hit x from two sides (beats standard; loses to a stack on x and to aggressive_mid); default_mid = spread, fight for mid, hit late the site with fewer CTs (beats stacks and retakes; loses to aggressive_mid); fake_x_go_y = utility at x, then hit y (beats standard and a stack on x; loses to a stack on y).\nutility: none ($0) | smokes (smoke + flash each, ~$500) | flash_heavy (2 flashes + smoke, ~$700) | full (smoke, 2 flashes, molotov, ~$1,100). More utility wins more executes, splits, fakes and post-plants; rushes only use the flashes.\npace: fast (hit earlier: a little better vs aggressive_mid, a little worse vs the rest) | default (best in general) | slow (more mid duels: a little better for default_mid vs stacks, worse vs aggressive_mid). Rushes ignore pace.\nawp: true = on a full buy your AWPer buys an AWP if he can afford it (+3-7 points: best in long, unsmoked duels)."},{"n":14,"side":1,"situation":"Map: Mirage. Round 14 (second half, round 2 of 12 of this half; first to 13 wins). You are CT (defend A and B, defuse). Score: you 10 - 3 them.\nYour money: $18,200 total — nexa (IGL) $4,000, tecno (AWPer) $4,000, juno (Entry) $3,400, bolt (Support) $3,400, omen (Lurker) $3,400.\nFull buy now costs your team about $19,750 (NOT affordable).\nLoss bonus: if you lose this round each player gets $1,400 (level 0/4; each loss raises it one level, each win lowers it one level).\nIf you eco now and lose, you will have about $25,200 next round (enough for a full buy next round; a full buy from nothing costs about $23,000).\nKept from last round: nexa: USP-S, kevlar; tecno: USP-S, kevlar; juno: USP-S, kevlar; bolt: USP-S, kevlar; omen: USP-S, kevlar.\nEnemy (T) estimated money: $7,000-$9,000 (probably cannot full buy); they kept 0 rifle(s)/AWP; their next loss pays $2,400 each (level 2/4).\nAWP: you have no AWP kept (a full buy with \"awp\":true buys one if the AWPer can afford it); the enemy kept no AWP.\nOpponent's last rounds as T (oldest first):\n- R13 [they T] pistol buy: default_mid, hit B, pace default, threw 0 smokes 0 flashes 0 molotovs; no plant -> we won (time ran out)\nTheir T-side tendencies this match (1 rounds): default_mid x1; hit A x0, hit B x1.\nYour last rounds as CT (oldest first):\n- R13 [we CT] pistol buy: standard_2_1_2, utility normal vs their default_mid (pistol buy, hit B) -> we WON (time ran out)\n","schema":"{\"buy\":\"eco|half|force|full\",\"setup\":\"standard_2_1_2|stack_a|stack_b|aggressive_mid|retake_b|retake_a\",\"utility\":\"save|normal|heavy\",\"awp\":true|false}\nbuy: eco = buy nothing and save; half = each player spends at most 45% of his money (max $2,100) on an SMG or P250, kevlar and a flash/smoke; force = spend everything on the best you can (AK/M4 if you can pay it plus kevlar, else Galil/FAMAS, else SMG, else Deagle/P250), then helmet, then your utility; full = rifles (the AWPer buys an AWP if \"awp\":true and he can pay it plus kevlar), helmets, kits (CT) and your utility; on a full buy rich players drop rifles to teammates who cannot afford one. In pistol rounds ($800) full and force both mean kevlar + pistol.\nsetup (see the round-win table in the rules): standard_2_1_2 = 2 A, 1 window, 2 B, rotate on contact (safest: beats rushes, loses to fakes and splits); stack_a / stack_b = 4 on that site, 1 on the other (crushes any hit on the stacked site, loses to hits on the other site, fakes of the stacked site and default_mid); aggressive_mid = 3 push mid for early picks, 1 per site (beats default_mid, splits and executes; rushes walk into its empty sites); retake_a / retake_b = give that site up (1 hidden player), 3 hold the other site, then retake together after the plant (beats rushes and executes into the held site, and rushes into the given site; loses to executes and default_mid into the given site).\nutility: save (none, $0) | normal (flash + smoke each, ~$500) | heavy (molotov, smoke, flash, HE each, ~$1,300: takes 1-13 points from the T, most vs rushes and hits into a defended site).\nawp: true = on a full buy your AWPer buys an AWP if he can afford it (+3-7 points: best in long, unsmoked holds)."},{"n":15,"side":0,"situation":"Map: Mirage. Round 15 (second half, round 3 of 12 of this half; first to 13 wins). You are T (attack: plant the bomb at A or B). Score: you 3 - 11 them.\nYour money: $10,350 total — drift (IGL) $2,400, ruin (AWPer) $2,400, oxide (Entry) $2,400, dazed (Support) $3,000, taz (Lurker) $150.\nFull buy now costs your team about $20,350 (NOT affordable).\nLoss bonus: if you lose this round each player gets $2,900 (level 3/4; each loss raises it one level, each win lowers it one level).\nIf you eco now and lose, you will have about $24,850 next round (enough for a full buy next round; a full buy from nothing costs about $21,000).\nKept from last round: taz: Glock-18, kevlar.\nEnemy (CT) estimated money: $15,500-$20,000 (can probably full buy); they kept 4 rifle(s)/AWP; their next loss pays $1,400 each (level 0/4).\nAWP: you have no AWP kept (a full buy with \"awp\":true buys one if the AWPer can afford it); the enemy kept no AWP.\nOpponent's last rounds as CT (oldest first):\n- R13 [they CT] pistol buy: standard_2_1_2 (2 A, 1 mid, 2 B), threw 0 utility; we hit B -> they won (time ran out)\n- R14 [they CT] full buy: standard_2_1_2 (2 A, 1 mid, 2 B), threw 5 utility; we hit A -> they won (time ran out)\nTheir CT-side tendencies this match (2 rounds): standard_2_1_2 x2.\nYour last rounds as T (oldest first):\n- R13 [we T] pistol buy: default_mid, utility flash_heavy, pace default vs their standard_2_1_2 (pistol buy) -> we LOST (time ran out)\n- R14 [we T] half buy: split_a, utility smokes, pace default vs their standard_2_1_2 (full buy) -> we LOST (time ran out)\n","schema":"{\"buy\":\"eco|half|force|full\",\"strategy\":\"rush_a|rush_b|execute_a|execute_b|split_a|split_b|default_mid|fake_a_go_b|fake_b_go_a\",\"utility\":\"none|smokes|flash_heavy|full\",\"pace\":\"fast|default|slow\",\"awp\":true|false}\nbuy: eco = buy nothing and save; half = each player spends at most 45% of his money (max $2,100) on an SMG or P250, kevlar and a flash/smoke; force = spend everything on the best you can (AK/M4 if you can pay it plus kevlar, else Galil/FAMAS, else SMG, else Deagle/P250), then helmet, then your utility; full = rifles (the AWPer buys an AWP if \"awp\":true and he can pay it plus kevlar), helmets, kits (CT) and your utility; on a full buy rich players drop rifles to teammates who cannot afford one. In pistol rounds ($800) full and force both mean kevlar + pistol.\nstrategy (see the round-win table in the rules): rush_x = all 5 run into site x at once (beats aggressive_mid and a stack on the other site; loses to a stack on x, to standard and to retakes, especially vs heavy CT utility); execute_x = take control, then hit x together with utility (beats retake_x and standard a little; loses to a stack on x and to aggressive_mid); split_x = hit x from two sides (beats standard; loses to a stack on x and to aggressive_mid); default_mid = spread, fight for mid, hit late the site with fewer CTs (beats stacks and retakes; loses to aggressive_mid); fake_x_go_y = utility at x, then hit y (beats standard and a stack on x; loses to a stack on y).\nutility: none ($0) | smokes (smoke + flash each, ~$500) | flash_heavy (2 flashes + smoke, ~$700) | full (smoke, 2 flashes, molotov, ~$1,100). More utility wins more executes, splits, fakes and post-plants; rushes only use the flashes.\npace: fast (hit earlier: a little better vs aggressive_mid, a little worse vs the rest) | default (best in general) | slow (more mid duels: a little better for default_mid vs stacks, worse vs aggressive_mid). Rushes ignore pace.\nawp: true = on a full buy your AWPer buys an AWP if he can afford it (+3-7 points: best in long, unsmoked duels)."},{"n":15,"side":1,"situation":"Map: Mirage. Round 15 (second half, round 3 of 12 of this half; first to 13 wins). You are CT (defend A and B, defuse). Score: you 11 - 3 them.\nYour money: $17,550 total — nexa (IGL) $3,300, tecno (AWPer) $3,900, juno (Entry) $3,550, bolt (Support) $3,550, omen (Lurker) $3,250.\nFull buy now costs your team about $7,400 (affordable).\nLoss bonus: if you lose this round each player gets $1,400 (level 0/4; each loss raises it one level, each win lowers it one level).\nKept from last round: nexa: M4A1-S, kevlar+helmet; tecno: M4A1-S, kevlar+helmet; bolt: FAMAS, kevlar+helmet; omen: FAMAS, kevlar+helmet.\nEnemy (T) estimated money: $8,500-$11,000 (probably cannot full buy); they kept 0 rifle(s)/AWP; their next loss pays $2,900 each (level 3/4).\nAWP: you have no AWP kept (a full buy with \"awp\":true buys one if the AWPer can afford it); the enemy kept no AWP.\nOpponent's last rounds as T (oldest first):\n- R13 [they T] pistol buy: default_mid, hit B, pace default, threw 0 smokes 0 flashes 0 molotovs; no plant -> we won (time ran out)\n- R14 [they T] half buy: split_a, hit A, pace default, threw 0 smokes 0 flashes 0 molotovs; no plant -> we won (time ran out)\nTheir T-side tendencies this match (2 rounds): default_mid x1, split_a x1; hit A x1, hit B x1.\nYour last rounds as CT (oldest first):\n- R13 [we CT] pistol buy: standard_2_1_2, utility normal vs their default_mid (pistol buy, hit B) -> we WON (time ran out)\n- R14 [we CT] full buy: standard_2_1_2, utility heavy vs their split_a (half buy, hit A) -> we WON (time ran out)\n","schema":"{\"buy\":\"eco|half|force|full\",\"setup\":\"standard_2_1_2|stack_a|stack_b|aggressive_mid|retake_b|retake_a\",\"utility\":\"save|normal|heavy\",\"